OL,3,AIran faces 'greatest financial
OL,4,Aoffensive ever', says US treasury
OL,5,Asecretary
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US announced a host of sanctions
OL,8,Fagainst Iran and threatened its
OL,9,Fsupporters in what Treasury Secretary
OL,10,FScott Bessent said was "the single
OL,11,Fgreatest financial offensive ever".
OL,13,FLabelling it an "economic D-Day" for
OL,14,FIran, Bessent said the US would sever
OL,15,Fall economic ties with the country and
OL,16,Fadded that any nation financially
OL,17,Fpartnering with Iran would also be
OL,18,Fisolated.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
